    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CNT == 1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"cnt == 1 is the conditional event in the student program that checks whether exactly one pair of mirror elements in a subarray differ, which is intended to validate the '好数组' condition but contains a logical flaw."</data>
