    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CNT[M]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"cnt[M] is a frequency counter array in the student’s code, used to count occurrences of each value in the input array to optimize computation of pairs."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt[M] is a frequency counter array in the student’s code, used to track occurrences of each value in the input array."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt[M] is an array in the student's code used to count the frequency of each integer value in the input array. It enables efficient lookup during the solution process."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt[M] is an array in the student's code used to count the frequency of each integer value in the input array, enabling efficient computation of pair counts."</data>
