    <node id="&quot;GCD(A_I, A_J)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"gcd(a_i, a_j) is the greatest common divisor of two array elements a_i and a_j, acting as a derived geometric constraint in the numerical space that must equal their bitwise XOR."</data>
