      <data key="d1">"std::unique is a C++ standard library function used in the student's code to remove consecutive duplicate elements from the sorted array, effectively reducing the problem space to unique values for processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"std::unique is a C++ standard library function used in the student’s code to remove duplicate elements from the sorted array, reducing the search space."</data>
