    <node id="&quot;N×N MATRIX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"n×n matrix is the input data structure in the problem, composed of '0' and '1' characters arranged in n rows and n columns, which the student program must transform into a '好矩阵' using adjacent swaps."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADJACENT SWAP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"adjacent swap is the allowed operation in the problem, where two neighboring characters (horizontally or vertically) in the matrix are exchanged, used by the student program to move '1's to the target quadrant."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOP-LEFT QUADRANT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"top-left quadrant refers to the sub-region of the matrix defined by rows 1 to n/2 and columns 1 to n/2, which must contain all '1's in a '好矩阵' and is the target destination for all '1' elements in the transformation process."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;操作次数上限 N³/2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"操作次数上限 n³/2 是问题对解法效率的约束条件，表示将矩阵转换为好矩阵所需的相邻交换次数不能超过该值。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 57-2&quot;">
