    <node id="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A computational algorithm used for traversing or searching grid-based structures, implemented in the provided C++ code snippet, which the student failed to correctly apply or understand."</data>
