    <node id="&quot;F&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A boolean flag variable used in the code to track whether any element in a row or column exceeds the value 1; its incorrect usage leads to logical errors in the student's solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"A boolean flag variable used in the code to track whether any element in a row or column exceeds the value of 1, influencing the logic for setting the 'cnt' counter or 'flag' status."&lt;SEP&gt;"F is a 2D map used to track and count unique adjacent 0s encountered during BFS, preventing double-counting and ensuring accurate boundary evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"f 是学生程序中用于记录字符是否已出现的哈希映射，辅助判断字符重复性以计算可爱度。"&lt;SEP&gt;"f is a boolean flag variable used in the code to indicate whether any element in a row or column exceeds 1, influencing the final count logic."</data>
