    <node id="&quot;STD::CIN.TIE(NULLPTR),STD::COUT.TIE(NULLPTR)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"C++ function calls that untie cin from cout to improve I/O performance in competitive programming, often used together with sync_with_stdio for faster input/output handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"These C++ directives untie the cin and cout streams to improve I/O performance, typically used in high-speed competitive programming solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"这是C++中用于提升输入输出效率的优化语句，通过解除cin与cout的同步绑定，加速程序运行，是学生程序中用于性能调优的工程实践。"&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a C++ optimization technique used to disable synchronization between C and C++ standard streams for faster I/O, commonly employed in competitive programming to improve runtime performance."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61548360973c5cefdc1038d32bf69e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2</data>
    </node>
