      <data key="d2">chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 78-2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Record ID: 78-2 is a system-generated log entry timestamped 2025-01-24 16:44:17, identifying this specific submission and error case for review or grading purposes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d855de4fc3c8066acae7529422e672d6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can unleash a 'Dragon's Breath' ability on a grid map to defeat monsters by targeting specific coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can unleash a special ability called 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can use a special ability called 'Dragon's Breath' to eliminate monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the ability 'Dragon's Breath' to eliminate monsters on a grid map by targeting specific coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and uses the 'Dragon's Breath' ability to eliminate monsters on a grid map by targeting specific coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who rides a dragon and can use the ability 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters on a grid map by targeting specific coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the computation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the computation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the calculation of the expected value of the sum of absolute differences between consecutive elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving the expected value of the absolute difference sum of a randomly generated sequence of integers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person associated with a mathematical problem involving a sequence of random integers and the computation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum between consecutive elements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c9f94da5a947d7ca0394b058d44d06</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that creates an 'X'-shaped flame pattern radiating diagonally from a targeted coordinate, defeating all monsters along those diagonal lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters along diagonal lines from a selected coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters along four diagonal directions from a chosen coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from the targeted coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters at coordinates along two diagonal lines extending from the target point."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze that releases flame in an 'X' shape across a grid, destroying monsters on diagonal paths from the targeted coordinate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A grid map with n rows and m columns, where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters denoted by a_{i,j}. The map is the battlefield where Dragon's Breath is applied."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters represented by a_{i,j}. It is the battlefield where Dragon's Breath is applied."&lt;SEP&gt;"A grid map with n rows and m columns, where each cell (i,j) contains a_{i,j} monsters. The map is the battlefield where Dragon's Breath is applied to maximize monster elimination."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters represented by a_{i,j}. It is the battlefield for the Dragon's Breath ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n-row by m-column rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a number of monsters represented by a_{i,j}, and is the battlefield for the Dragon's Breath ability."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"a_{i,j} denotes the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) on the grid map, forming the numerical data structure that Dragon's Breath acts upon."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) on the grid map, used to compute total damage from Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the numerical value representing the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) in the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the numerical value representing the number of monsters located at grid coordinate (i,j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the numerical value representing the count of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_{i,j} is the numerical value representing the number of monsters located at coordinate (i,j) in the grid map, forming the data basis for calculating Dragon's Breath damage."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;(X-1,Y-1)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"(x-1,y-1) is one of the four diagonal directions from the target coordinate (x,y) where Dragon's Breath flame extends, forming part of the X-pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x-1,y-1) is one of the four diagonal directions from the target coordinate (x,y) where Dragon's Breath flame propagates."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x-1,y-1) is one of the four diagonal directions from the target coordinate (x,y) where Dragon's Breath flame propagates."&lt;SEP&gt;"(x-1,y-1) is one of the four diagonal directions in which Dragon's Breath flame propagates from the center coordinate (x,y)."&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the four diagonal directions from the center (x,y) where Dragon's Breath flame propagates, extending the destruction pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the four diagonal directions from the target (x,y) where Dragon's Breath flame propagates, destroying monsters along that diagonal line."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
    </node>
