    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE AND ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tokitsukaze and Absolute Expectation is the named event or problem instance involving the computation of the expected value of the absolute differences in a randomly generated sequence of integers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze and Absolute Expectation is the named problem event involving the computation of the expected value of the absolute difference sum of a random integer sequence with bounds [l_i, r_i]."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;E[VAL(A)]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"E[val(a)] is the expected value of the sequence's val(a) function, which is the central quantity Tokitsukaze seeks to compute."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2a6cf2c1b884640bd458e20b236729e4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;L[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"L[i] represents the lower bound of the interval [l_i, r_i] from which the i-th element a_i of the sequence is randomly generated, critical for defining the probability distribution of each element."&lt;SEP&gt;"L[i] represents the lower bound of the random integer range for the i-th element in the sequence, used in the computation of expected absolute differences."&lt;SEP&gt;"L[i] represents the lower bound of the random integer range for the i-th element in the sequence; it is a mathematical parameter, not a physical location — but constrained to allowed types, classified as geo by default due to lack of better fit."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;R[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"R[i] represents the upper bound of the interval [l_i, r_i] from which the i-th element a_i of the sequence is randomly generated, working with L[i] to define the uniform random range for each sequence element."&lt;SEP&gt;"R[i] represents the upper bound of the random integer range for the i-th element in the sequence, used in the computation of expected absolute differences."&lt;SEP&gt;"R[i] represents the upper bound of the random integer range for the i-th element in the sequence; it is a mathematical parameter, not a physical location — but constrained to allowed types, classified as geo by default due to lack of better fit."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOLVE(INT A, INT B)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"solve is a helper function in the student's program that computes the expected absolute difference contribution between two uniformly random integer ranges, using modular arithmetic and combinatorial formulas."&lt;SEP&gt;"solve is a helper function in the student's program that computes the expected absolute difference for two integer ranges [0,a] and [0,b], used to derive the expectation for arbitrary ranges [l_i, r_i]."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUERY(INT I, INT J)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"query is a function in the student's program that computes the expected absolute difference between two sequence elements a_i and a_j by combining four solve() calls to handle interval boundaries correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"query is a function in the student's program that computes the expected absolute difference between two sequence elements a_i and a_j using inclusion-exclusion over their respective ranges [l_i, r_i] and [l_j, r_j]."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MODULAR ARITHMETIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Modular Arithmetic is the computational framework used in the student’s program, with modulo 10^9 + 7, to handle large integer operations and prevent overflow."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-52425facb0b31d12436db806ca0992de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POW(INT A, INT B)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pow is a modular exponentiation function used to compute modular inverses, essential for division under modulo arithmetic in the student's solution."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;炸鸡&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">炸鸡是中文网络文化中一个具有象征性意义的多面性虚构角色，兼具教育者与井字棋（tic-tac-toe）对手的双重身份，深刻体现了权威性与启发性相融合的教育哲学。作为小L的导师，炸鸡系统性地指导其掌握基础数学与计算思维，内容涵盖平方与开方、数字变换操作、二进制数处理及异或运算等位运算知识，常以教师、辅导者或出题者的身份出现，通过寓教于乐的方式帮助小L理解抽象的逻辑与数学概念，旨在系统性地拓展其编程能力与认知发展。

在非教学场景中，炸鸡作为小L在井字棋对弈中的对手，展现出高度的自信甚至自负，其棋艺远超小L。然而，炸鸡并未倚仗绝对优势压制对手，反而主动授予小L一项特殊优势——“双步特权”，即允许小L在单回合内连续走两步。这一行为并非源于轻敌或疏忽，而是基于炸鸡对自身策略深度的绝对信心：他坚信，即便在给予此特权的前提下，只要双方均采取最优策略，小L仍无法获胜。这种设计不仅体现了炸鸡作为高阶棋手的战术智慧，更隐喻其深刻的教育理念——通过设置看似公平却极具挑战性的条件，激发学习者的潜能，培养其战略思维、独立解决问题的能力与抗压心理。

综合来看，炸鸡的“过自信”性格特征与其“主动给予特权”的行为模式相辅相成，共同构建出一个既强势又富有智慧的指导者形象。他并非以权威压制，而是以策略性引导促进成长，在数学训练与智力博弈的双重路径中，潜移默化地提升小L的逻辑推理能力、计算思维与战略意识。在中文网络语境中，炸鸡已成为一种文化隐喻，代表那些具备高阶能力、却以包容、智慧与结构性挑战方式推动学习者进化的教育者或思想型挑战者。</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">小L是一位兼具学术探索者与策略游戏玩家双重身份的进取型学习者，始终以主动探究和深度理解为核心驱动力。在学术领域，他专注于两个具有挑战性的独立研究方向：数值变换与位运算。在数值变换研究中，他系统性地探索通过“乘以2”与“开平方下取整”的操作序列，将起始数字n转换为目标数字m的路径，深入分析平方与开方运算在数值序列中的非线性动态行为、收敛特性及其数学逻辑；在位运算研究中，他分析三个n位二进制数a、b、c，通过位翻转与位交换操作，使a⊕b=c成立，从而系统性地理解异或运算的代数性质、位级逻辑等价性及其在计算系统中的基础作用。这两个课题虽在数学背景与操作类型上迥异，却共同体现了他对抽象数学原理与计算机科学底层机制的深刻兴趣与实践能力。

在休闲策略游戏领域，小L是一名井字棋（tic-tac-toe）的初学者玩家，当前正与对手“炸鸡”进行一场尚未分出胜负的对局。为平衡其新手身份并拓展策略探索空间，他被赋予一项特殊特权：在整个对局中仅有一次机会可以连续进行两次移动。当前轮到小L行动，他正处在决定是否以及如何使用这一关键特权的决策节点，展现出其在即时情境中灵活运用规则优势、规划多步策略的适应能力。尽管身为新手，他并未局限于表面规则，而是将学术中培养的系统性思维与问题分解能力迁移至游戏场景，试图通过这一稀缺的双步特权创造战术优势，深化对博弈结构的理解。

综合而言，小L是一位善于在复杂抽象系统中迁移思维、连接理论与实践的年轻学习者。他通过严谨的数学建模与编程实践深化对算法与逻辑的理解，同时在规则受限的策略游戏中检验和锤炼其决策能力。无论是面对数值序列的收敛难题，还是井字棋中一次性的双步特权，小L均展现出卓越的问题分解能力、系统性思维与主动学习的特质。所有描述一致指向同一主体——小L，一位在学术与游戏双重维度中追求深度理解与策略创新的进取型学习者。</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;平方和开方运算&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"平方和开方运算是炸鸡教授给小L的两种数学操作，分别对应乘以2和开平方后下取整，构成问题的核心操作集。"&lt;SEP&gt;"平方和开方运算是炸鸡教授给小L的两种数学操作，包括将数字乘以2和将数字开平方后下取整，用于数字变换过程。"&lt;SEP&gt;"平方和开方运算是炸鸡教授给小L的两种数学操作，包括将数字乘以2（平方的逆操作）和将数字开平方后下取整，用于解决数字转换问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"平方和开方运算是炸鸡教授给小L的两种数学操作，分别对应乘以2和开平方后下取整，构成题目中的核心操作集。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d</data>
    </node>
