      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Record ID: 86-1 is a system identifier for this specific submission and error log, timestamped 2025-02-08 13:15:08, used for tracking the student's attempt and feedback."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d</data>
