    </node>
    <node id="&quot;井字棋&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"井字棋是一种3x3格子的回合制棋类游戏，玩家通过将三个棋子连成一线（行、列或对角线）获胜。当前为残局状态，双方落子数相等，尚未分出胜负，轮到小L行动。"&lt;SEP&gt;"井字棋是小L与炸鸡正在进行的策略性棋类游戏，目标是率先在行、列或对角线上形成三个相同棋子的连线，当前为残局状态，双方落子数相等且未分胜负。"&lt;SEP&gt;井字棋是一种3x3网格的两人回合制策略游戏，属于零和博弈，玩家轮流在棋盘上落子，目标是率先将自己的三个棋子连成一条直线——无论是横向、纵向还是对角线，从而赢得比赛。当前，井字棋正处于残局状态，由玩家小L与炸鸡正在进行对弈，双方落子数量相等，尚未分出胜负，且当前轮到小L行动。所有描述一致表明该游戏规则清晰、结构对称，且局面处于关键转折点，下一步行动将直接影响胜负走向。</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;棋盘&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"棋盘是一个3x3的网格结构，包含9个单元格，每个单元格可为'X'（小L的棋子）、'O'（炸鸡的棋子）或'G'（空位），是井字棋对局的物理和逻辑空间。"&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘是一个3行3列的网格结构，共有9个位置，用于进行井字棋对局，每个位置由坐标(i,j)标识，状态可为'X'、'O'或'G'。"&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘是一个3行3列的网格结构，共有9个位置，用于进行井字棋对弈，每个位置可为'X'（小L的棋子）、'O'（炸鸡的棋子）或'G'（空位）。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;三连一线&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"三连一线是井字棋的获胜条件，指在同一行、同一列或同一对角线上出现三个相同的棋子（全为'X'或全为'O'）。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;连续走两步特权&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"连续走两步特权是炸鸡赋予小L的特殊规则，允许小L在接下来的某一次行动中连续下两个子，打破常规轮流规则，是影响胜负的关键变量。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连续走两步特权是炸鸡赋予小L的特殊规则，允许小L在接下来的某一次行动中连续下两个子，是影响胜负的关键变量。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;3X3 GRID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">The 3x3 grid is the playing field of the tic-tac-toe game, consisting of nine cells arranged in three rows and three columns, each uniquely identified by coordinates (i,j), where i represents the row and j represents the column, both ranging from 1 to 3. This grid provides the structural framework within which players make their moves, placing marks in the cells to achieve three in a line—either horizontally, vertically, or diagonally. Each cell can contain one of three states: 'X' or 'O' to represent the marks of the two players, or 'G' to denote an empty or unoccupied space. The grid's uniform structure enables the systematic tracking of gameplay and outcomes, forming the foundational element of the tic-tac-toe game.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a625df4ed1e048ecc8681beebcec0a9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIAGONAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A diagonal refers to one of the two diagonal lines on the 3x3 grid — from top-left to bottom-right or top-right to bottom-left — that can form a winning line if all three cells contain the same player’s mark."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INSTRUCTOR / EVALUATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
