    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WIN CONDITION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The win condition in the tic-tac-toe game is achieved when a player aligns three of their symbols ('X' or 'O') in a row, column, or diagonal, resulting in an immediate victory."&lt;SEP&gt;"The win condition in this tic-tac-toe game requires a player to align three of their symbols ('X' or 'O') in a straight line—horizontally, vertically, or diagonally—before the opponent does."&lt;SEP&gt;"The win condition in the tic-tac-toe game is achieved when a player gets three of their marks in a row, column, or diagonal. The game state guarantees this has not yet occurred."&lt;SEP&gt;"The win condition in tic-tac-toe requires a player to align three of their marks ('X' or 'O') in a row, column, or diagonal. This event determines the outcome of the game."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TWO-MOVE PRIVILEGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The two-move privilege is a special rule granted to 小L, allowing them to make two consecutive moves in one turn at some point during the game, intended to offset their inexperience."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;3X3棋盘&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"3x3棋盘是井字棋游戏的竞技场地，由3行3列共9个单元格组成，每个单元格可为'X'、'O'或'G'，代表小L、炸鸡的落子或空位。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;S_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"s_{i,j} is the state variable representing the content of the cell at position (i,j) on the tic-tac-toe board, which can be 'X', 'O', or 'G'."&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j}是表示棋盘上第i行第j列单元格状态的符号系统，取值为'X'（小L）、'O'（炸鸡）或'G'（空），用于描述当前残局的精确配置。"&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j}是表示棋盘中第i行第j列单元格状态的符号，取值为'X'、'O'或'G'，用于描述当前残局的布局。"&lt;SEP&gt;"s_{i,j} is the state variable representing the content of the cell at position (i,j) on the tic-tac-toe board, with possible values 'X', 'O', or 'G'."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;连成一线&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"连成一线是井字棋的获胜条件，指在任意一行、一列或一条对角线上出现三个相同的棋子（'X'或'O'），标志着该玩家获胜。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连成一线是指在棋盘的某一行、某一列或某一条对角线上，三个格子被同一玩家的棋子占据，是判定胜利的必要条件。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DOUBLE MOVE PRIVILEGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The double move privilege is a special rule granted to 小L by 炸鸡, allowing 小L to make two consecutive moves in a single turn at some point during the remainder of the game, despite normally alternating turns."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2025-02-08 16:06:40&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A timestamp indicating the exact moment the error was logged, serving as a geographical and temporal marker for the event in a system context."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c79d0a874a6ba47efd4742ec70c1e196</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;行&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"行是棋盘中水平的三条线，每行包含三个单元格，若某行三个单元格均为同一玩家的棋子，则该玩家获胜。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;列&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"列是棋盘中垂直的三条线，每列包含三个单元格，若某列三个单元格均为同一玩家的棋子，则该玩家获胜。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;对角线&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"对角线是棋盘中两条斜线：从左上到右下和从右上到左下，每条对角线包含三个单元格，若某条对角线全为同一玩家棋子，则该玩家获胜。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;特权&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"特权是指炸鸡赋予小L在后续某一次行动中连续走两步的特殊权利，这一机制打破了常规井字棋的轮流规则，可能改变博弈均衡。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;残局&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"残局是指井字棋对局中双方已进行若干步、落子数相等、尚未分出胜负的中间状态，当前轮到小L行动，是分析必胜策略的起点。"&lt;SEP&gt;"残局是指井字棋对弈过程中，双方已进行若干步落子、尚未分出胜负、且落子数量相等的当前局面。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7</data>
    </node>
