    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THREE-IN-A-ROW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Three-in-a-row is the winning condition in tic-tac-toe, where a player must align three of their marks (X or O) in a straight line — horizontally, vertically, or diagonally."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8</data>
    </node>
