      <data key="d1">"c_i is the target position in the original array for the i-th query, for which the new position after sorting [l_i, r_i] must be determined."&lt;SEP&gt;"c_i is the target position in the original array for the i-th query, for which the new position after sorting [l_i, r_i] must be determined."&lt;SEP&gt;"c_i is the target position in the original array for the i-th query, for which the new position after sorting the subinterval [l_i, r_i] must be determined."</data>
