      <data key="d1">"The solve function takes l_i, r_i, and c_i as inputs for each query to perform subinterval sorting and track element movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"l_i, r_i, c_i are parameters of each query: defining a subarray [l_i, r_i] and the original position c_i of the element whose new position after sorting is to be determined."</data>
