    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;C++&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红's problem is solved using C++ in the student's implementation, making C++ the medium through which her definition is computationally tested."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem is solved using C++ in the student's implementation, making C++ the medium through which the problem is computationally addressed."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题虽未指定语言，但学生使用C++实现，C++是解决该问题的工具语言，承载了小红的逻辑需求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出的问题虽为数学问题，但其解决方案需通过C++编程实现，学生程序即为该语言的尝试。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-56cf64b248d90f79e1afa9d0cd84c04a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3f9d595e0b4dc6b94e1564563f7ded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e</data>
