      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 initiated the 3阶行列式 construction event by posing the mathematical problem to be solved."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是3阶行列式构造问题的提出者，该行列式是她要求实现的数学对象。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is the person who requests the construction of the 3阶行列式 with specific constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是提出构造3阶行列式任务的主体，该事件由她发起并定义了约束条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-122f34a10a694b4546099c481788102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-468ecda2a7ffd84f7956eab9b179bd56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01</data>
