    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I,R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 specifies that each position i in the permutation must contain a value within the range [l_i, r_i], defining the core constraint of the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红设定的约束条件是每个位置 i 的元素必须落在 [l_i,r_i] 区间内，这是问题的直接输入要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
