    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;相邻字符交换&quot;">
      <data key="d3">35.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 relies on the operation of swapping adjacent characters as the only means to transform the matrix into the desired state."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 specifies that adjacent character swaps are the only allowed operation to achieve the '好矩阵' target."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了相邻字符交换作为唯一允许的操作方式，用于将任意01矩阵转化为好矩阵，是该操作的规则制定者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红被赋予使用相邻字符交换作为唯一操作手段来实现目标，是该事件的执行主体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2c34d00a1cb1d7916cefb78fbc43896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32</data>
