      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable cnt counts mismatches between symmetric elements in a subarray to determine if exactly one modification makes it a palindrome."&lt;SEP&gt;"cnt变量用于统计子数组中对称位置不匹配的元素对数量，是判断是否为‘好数组’的关键计数依据。"</data>
