    <edge source="&quot;学生程序&quot;" target="&quot;N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">31.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student program reads n as input to determine the length of the output string."&lt;SEP&gt;"The variable n is read from input and defines the total size of the array to be processed by the student program."&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序读取输入参数n作为目标字符串长度，并据此分配和构造字符串。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序从输入读取 n，作为字符串长度的约束条件，用于生成输出字符串。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7b7c2c9549b0f15b3ed9c255cd57c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58149e2705f5337a0bc1e192ab33a56</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
