      <data key="d3">13.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The integer '-1' is a fixed matrix element in the Student Program, contributing to determinant computation but not dynamically adjusted for x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The value -1 is explicitly used in the Student Program's matrix as a deliberate choice to adjust the determinant's value toward x."</data>
