      <data key="d3">13.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The integer '2' is a hardcoded matrix element (variable 'c') in the Student Program, limiting the solution’s flexibility for arbitrary x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The value 2 is a fixed element in the middle-center position of the matrix in the Student Program, contributing to the determinant calculation."</data>
