      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The integer '3' is used in the Student Program to compute 'e' as (x+1)/3, forming the core of its flawed logic for determinant control."&lt;SEP&gt;"The number 3 is used in the Student Program as a divisor to compute element e from x; its use is central to the algorithm's logic but also the source of its error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1</data>
