    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">69.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 的核心功能是接收x作为输入，并据此计算并输出满足条件的3阶行列式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 的目标是根据输入x构造行列式，x是程序计算的核心目标值，程序逻辑直接依赖于x的值。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is designed to accept 'x' as input and produce a matrix whose determinant equals 'x', making 'x' the critical input-output variable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is designed to compute a matrix whose determinant equals x, making x the primary input and goal of the program."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program takes x as input and attempts to compute matrix elements such that the determinant equals x, but fails due to flawed logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to compute a matrix whose determinant equals x, but contains logic errors in calculating the element 'e' based on x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program takes x as input and attempts to compute matrix elements such that the determinant equals x, making x a critical parameter in the program’s logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program未正确处理x作为行列式输出值的要求，导致计算结果与x不一致，是错误的根本原因。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ba454db150409dfa2569afe0680c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-122f34a10a694b4546099c481788102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0c9c6802989382170739955a5bae46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-468ecda2a7ffd84f7956eab9b179bd56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;3阶行列式&quot;">
      <data key="d3">41.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program 试图生成一个3阶行列式，但其输出因逻辑错误而无法保证满足绝对值和行列式值的约束。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program旨在生成满足小红要求的3阶行列式，是实现该数学对象的自动化工具。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted solution to the 3阶行列式 construction problem, though it fails due to incorrect handling of x."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program outputs a specific 3阶行列式 based on input x, directly attempting to realize this mathematical object."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program试图解决3阶行列式构造问题，但其代码逻辑与题目要求不符，未能正确实现目标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ba454db150409dfa2569afe0680c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-122f34a10a694b4546099c481788102d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-468ecda2a7ffd84f7956eab9b179bd56</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;行列式构造问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program is the attempted solution to the determinant construction problem, though it is identified as incorrect."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 是针对行列式构造问题的解答尝试，但因逻辑错误未能正确满足条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 是为解决行列式构造问题而编写的程序，但其逻辑错误导致无法正确满足条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 是对行列式构造问题的解答尝试，但因逻辑错误未能正确满足所有条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ba454db150409dfa2569afe0680c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01</data>
