    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;中国&quot;">
      <data key="d3">170.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program is written in C++ with syntax and conventions typical of Chinese programming competitions (e.g., NOI, ICPC), indicating its origin within China's competitive programming education system."&lt;SEP&gt;The Student Program is a C++-based software artifact developed within China’s educational and competitive programming ecosystem, reflecting deep cultural and institutional roots in the country’s STEM education system. It is written using Chinese-language problem statements, variable comments, and annotations, which situate it firmly within a native Chinese academic context. The program adheres to a distinctive set of coding conventions widely recognized in Chinese programming competitions such as the National Olympiad in Informatics (NOI) and ACM-ICPC, including the use of #include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;, #define int long long, 1-indexed arrays, std::ios::sync_with_stdio, signed main, and std::pair (often with fi/se aliases). These stylistic and syntactic choices are hallmark practices in China’s competitive programming training environments and are commonly found on platforms like Luogu and Codeforces China. The convergence of linguistic elements (Chinese problem context and variable naming), structural patterns (e.g., 1-indexed arrays), and idiomatic C++ practices confirms that the Student Program was created by a Chinese student, likely as part of algorithmic competition preparation or coursework. Its design and implementation are not merely technical but are embedded in the pedagogical and cultural framework of China’s competitive programming community, making it a clear product of China’s programming education ecosystem.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0be1ff21d6f00384f294e712dc03c7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c5bdeaa2e5f505a00838eed99bce2dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d855de4fc3c8066acae7529422e672d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ba454db150409dfa2569afe0680c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0c9c6802989382170739955a5bae46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad0b2a1773fb3f15dee0ac6d32877cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811</data>
