    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">175.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 is the core implementation within the Student Program, providing the logic for answering range-based position queries."&lt;SEP&gt;Program Segment 1/2 is a core component of the Student Program, constituting the primary code implementation submitted by the student to solve the matrix transformation problem—specifically, the logic for moving '1's to the correct quadrant. It represents the central algorithmic implementation within the Student Program, containing the main logic for matrix manipulation, swap operations, and the attempted solution to the underlying computational task. Multiple descriptions confirm that Program Segment 1/2 is not merely a fragment but the substantive body of the student’s submission, carrying the core algorithmic logic that was evaluated and found to contain significant errors. These errors manifest as flawed logic in the movement of '1's, rendering the implementation erroneous despite its intended functionality. While some descriptions refer to it as “incomplete” or “incomplete code submission,” the consistent emphasis across all sources is that Program Segment 1/2 is the dominant, defining portion of the Student Program and the principal source of the identified defects. In Chinese-language descriptions, it is similarly characterized as the foundational element (“主体部分,” “核心内容”) of the Student Program, reinforcing its central role. Thus, Program Segment 1/2 is accurately understood as the actual, flawed implementation within the Student Program that was submitted as the student’s solution, and it remains the focal point of evaluation due to its critical role in the program’s failure to correctly perform the required matrix transformation.</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0be1ff21d6f00384f294e712dc03c7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98</data>
