    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;GCD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program relies on the mathematical property of gcd to identify valid pairs, but fails to correctly implement its relationship with xor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program uses gcd implicitly by iterating over divisors of a[i], attempting to satisfy the condition involving gcd in the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
