    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;XOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program uses the xor operator to compare values a[i] and j, attempting to match the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program uses xor in its logic to test the condition, but the implementation incorrectly assumes all divisors will yield valid xor matches."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
