    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 2/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">77.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 2/2 is a component of the Student Program responsible for outputting swap operations, and its flawed logic contributes to the overall error in the solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a core part of the Student Program containing the flawed logic for median calculation and operation counting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical component of the Student Program responsible for median-based transformation logic, which contains the errors causing partial correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is the specific implementation within the Student Program that contains the flawed logic responsible for the incorrect output."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical component of the Student Program, containing the core flawed logic used to compute the minimal operations for achieving a 双生数组."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2是Student Program的组成部分，其代码缺陷直接导致了整体程序的错误输出。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2是Student Program的组成部分，负责输出交换操作，其错误导致整体答案不正确。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a part of the Student Program that contains the implementation logic, which is flawed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 2/2 is a critical component of the Student Program responsible for counting and outputting swap operations, and its logic directly contributes to the observed error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d855de4fc3c8066acae7529422e672d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29764514e79d905f57239a2bf826b46d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70a2665d10418a7ca4b53ae850057cff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">47.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program aims to achieve the 双生数组 state but fails due to incorrect logic in selecting target values and computing operations, misaligning with the defined criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to transform an array into a 双生数组 but fails due to incorrect algorithmic logic in partitioning and median calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to transform an input array into a 双生数组 by minimizing operations, but contains critical bugs that prevent full correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform input arrays into ‘双生数组’ by minimizing operations, making the concept its explicit computational goal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to transform the input array into a ‘双生数组’ by computing minimum operations, making ‘双生数组’ the target state of the program’s logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e091fd25a6ba2509fa168c85c52636ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29764514e79d905f57239a2bf826b46d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0be1ff21d6f00384f294e712dc03c7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
