    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">108.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Student Program attempts to transform the input matrix into a '好矩阵' by moving '1's to the 左上区域 using adjacent swaps, but contains logical flaws leading to incorrect output."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program 的目标是将输入矩阵转化为好矩阵，但其算法逻辑存在错误，未能正确实现该目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted computational solution to achieve the '好矩阵' configuration, but contains bugs that prevent correct transformation of the input matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform the input matrix into a 好矩阵 by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant using adjacent swaps, directly targeting the event’s definition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to produce a '好矩阵' as its output, but fails due to incorrect logic in coordinate handling and swap sequencing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student Program的目标是生成将输入矩阵转化为好矩阵的交换序列，但当前实现未能达成该目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The goal of the Student Program is to transform the input matrix into a ‘好矩阵’, making the concept central to the program's intended functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program aims to transform an arbitrary 01 matrix into a '好矩阵' by implementing adjacent swaps, directly targeting the event's definition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted computational implementation to achieve the '好矩阵' condition by moving '1's into the top-left quadrant using adjacent swaps."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted algorithmic solution to convert any given 01 matrix into a '好矩阵' by swapping adjacent elements, but fails due to incorrect coordinate logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is designed to transform an arbitrary 01 matrix into a 好矩阵 by performing adjacent swaps, directly targeting the event's definition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is an attempted computational implementation of the '好矩阵' specification, using adjacent swaps to rearrange the matrix to meet the required pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program is designed to transform an input matrix into a好矩阵 using adjacent swaps, but fails to correctly position all '1's in the top-left quadrant."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-47e1da39547e4d5d5cdafb2530c061c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d855de4fc3c8066acae7529422e672d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-985dca88cf19334aa6bccf195ded5fbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-079897d4e6ab7c8bef85d55cc1a46ac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad0b2a1773fb3f15dee0ac6d32877cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c02916b7b0e5a87f92d544844a99ec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c5bdeaa2e5f505a00838eed99bce2dd</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
