      <data key="d4">"The student's program represents小L's attempted solution to the problem, encoding his strategy for transforming n into m using the taught operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L是Student Program的作者或使用者，试图通过该程序实现运算目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is the intended user of the Student Program, which attempts to solve the problem he was given by 炸鸡, but the program contains logical errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L编写或提交了Student Program作为解题方案，是该程序的直接作者和执行者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L’s problem is solved by the Student Program, which attempts to algorithmically determine if m is reachable from n using the defined operations."</data>
