    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">136.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Error Description 明确指出学生程序存在逻辑错误，是对其代码缺陷的正式记录和分析。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 is the code under evaluation in the Error Description, which explicitly states that this program is incorrect and does not match the expected solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 was evaluated and resulted in the Error Description, which documents its 40.0 score due to logical flaws in median selection and array handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 中的算法实现（如区间扩展、Max 更新逻辑）是导致 Error Description 中‘答案错误’的根本原因。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Description directly evaluates the correctness of Program Segment 1/2, identifying its partial success and logical flaws."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Description directly analyzes and identifies the flaws present in Program Segment 1/2, such as incorrect median selection and array swapping logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 is the source of the error described, which evaluates its logic flaws and assigns it a partial score of 40.0."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2的逻辑缺陷（如cnti/cntj更新错误、交换顺序混乱）直接导致了Error Description中指出的答案不正确。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The flaws in Program Segment 1/2 are explicitly identified and documented in the Error Description, linking the code to its evaluation failure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 is the specific code that the Error Description evaluates as incorrect, highlighting a mismatch between implementation and expected behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 中的逻辑错误直接导致 Error Description 中指出的‘答案不正确’和‘与正确答案存在差异’。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 的逻辑错误（如随机生成输入、错误的可爱度计算）直接导致 Error Description 中指出的答案不正确。"&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 是被Error Description评估为错误的代码实现，其逻辑缺陷导致无法正确生成合法操作序列。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The logic in Program Segment 1/2 is directly responsible for the errors described in the Error Description, as it fails to correctly position all '1's in the top-left quadrant."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eeffa4db6e2444dac981d2f6e46c8e68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d45a376c5f8e29b656fb8024a9e1fab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66aa472cb9a249d5511f69ff4cdc9520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0e68ffe11c5d605b2d172bc117a660&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c5bdeaa2e5f505a00838eed99bce2dd</data>
