      <data key="d3">74.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The error description documents the student's incorrect implementation, serving as the basis for the assessment record."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is directly responsible for the error documented in the error description, as their answer was marked incorrect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is the subject of the Error Description, which records their incorrect submission."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is the source of the incorrect answer that triggered the error description event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student submitted an incorrect answer that triggered the recorded error description, making them the direct source of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is the subject of the error description, as their incorrect answer triggered the recorded error."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is the subject of the error description, as their incorrect answer triggered the documented error."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student submitted the erroneous code that triggered the documented error event."</data>
