      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the even length of the input array, a required condition for a valid 双生数组; incorrect handling of n breaks partitioning logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;R&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"r is used interchangeably with n in the program, but inconsistent usage leads to indexing errors and logical mismatches in array traversal."</data>
