      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Map has n rows, defining its vertical size and constraining valid coordinate ranges."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map has n rows, making n a fundamental dimension defining its size."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the number of rows in the Grid Map, directly influencing the range and possible positions for Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the number of rows in the Grid Map, establishing its vertical size."</data>
