      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n is a critical parameter defining the size of the sequence involved in the Absolute Expectation problem, directly influencing the computation of the expected value."&lt;SEP&gt;"n is the key geometric parameter defining the size of the sequence involved in the Absolute Expectation problem, directly influencing the structure of the sum."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3</data>
