    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n determines the number of terms in the sum that defines val(a), as the summation runs from i=2 to n."&lt;SEP&gt;"val(a) sums over n-1 consecutive pairs, so n directly determines the number of terms in the value function."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-643a1dae351fde67dd0b6b4bafe4269b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f207867e95527d1c21eb90640d585ef3</data>
