    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;B&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the length of binary number b, determining how many bit positions can be operated on."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the length of binary string b, determining the number of bits that can be operated on."&lt;SEP&gt;"n 定义了二进制数 b 的长度，决定了其可操作位数的范围。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 定义了二进制数 b 的位数，决定了 b 的结构规模和可操作位的数量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
