      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"x is the target output value for the determinant construction problem, making it the central constraint of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"x 是行列式构造问题的核心输入参数，问题的解必须使行列式值精确等于x。"&lt;SEP&gt;"x is the target value that the constructed 3x3 determinant must equal, making it a core constraint in the determinant construction problem."</data>
