      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a 的每一位翻转操作花费 x 元，x 是改变 a 的最小成本单位。"&lt;SEP&gt;"x is the cost per bit flip operation applied to a, directly linking the cost parameter to operations on a."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
