      <data key="d4">"The symbol 'X' represents 小L's moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly associating the mark with the player."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L places 'X' marks on the board as their moves during the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L uses the symbol 'X' to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L uses the symbol 'X' to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe grid, establishing direct ownership and gameplay identity."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L uses the 'X' symbol to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe grid, making 'X' an extension of their gameplay."&lt;SEP&gt;"X is the symbol used to denote 小L's moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly representing 小L's actions in the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L uses 'X' as their symbol on the tic-tac-toe board to mark their moves during the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"X is the symbol used to represent 小L's moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly associating the mark with the player."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L uses the symbol 'X' to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe grid, and their strategy revolves around forming a line of three 'X's."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L uses the 'X' symbol to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, establishing a direct association between the player and their game piece."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L places X marks on the board as their moves in the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L uses the 'X' symbol to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, establishing a direct association between the player and their game piece."&lt;SEP&gt;"X is the symbol used by 小L to mark their moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly representing 小L's actions in the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"X is the symbol used to denote 小L's moves on the tic-tac-toe board, directly representing 小L's actions in the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L uses the 'X' symbol to mark their moves on the 3x3 grid during the tic-tac-toe game."</data>
