      <data key="d3">42.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'X' marks are placed within the 3x3 grid, which is the structural framework of the game where all player actions occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the spatial domain where 'X' marks are placed by 小L, and the positions of 'X' determine potential winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the spatial domain where 'X' marks are placed by 小L, defining the game state."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the spatial structure upon which 'X' symbols are placed by 小L to attempt to achieve a winning line."&lt;SEP&gt;"X marks are placed within the 3x3 grid at specific (i,j) coordinates to represent 小L's moves."</data>
