    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">51.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 aims to construct a 好矩阵 by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant, but contains logical flaws that prevent correct transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 aims to construct a 好矩阵 by moving '1's, but its algorithm incorrectly handles the positioning and counting, leading to failure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 implements an algorithm intended to construct a '好矩阵' by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant, but its coordinate update logic (cnti, cntj) is flawed, leading to incorrect placement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 的目标是构造好矩阵，但其交换逻辑错误，无法保证最终矩阵满足左上区域全为'1'的条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 attempts to construct a 好矩阵 by moving '1's to the top-left quadrant, but fails due to flawed coordinate logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Program Segment 1/2 contains logic intended to construct a '好矩阵', but contains a flaw in coordinate tracking (cnti, cntj) that prevents correct placement of '1's in the top-left quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"Program Segment 1/2 implements an algorithm intended to construct a 好矩阵 by relocating all '1's to the top-left quadrant, which is the core requirement of the 好矩阵 event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8639879bd177c95139010b9025b24c97</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;N×N矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The n×n matrix is the input to Program Segment 1/2, which reads and attempts to transform it — but the transformation logic is flawed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The n×n矩阵 is the input to the Student Program, which the program reads and attempts to transform, but incorrectly manipulates its elements."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;ADJACENT SWAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 uses adjacent swap operations to reposition '1's in the matrix, but its implementation incorrectly handles coordinate tracking and boundary conditions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;字符串 T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 的目标是构造满足条件的字符串 t，但其构造逻辑存在缺陷导致输出错误。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 尝试计算字符串的可爱度，但其 vis 和 f 数组的双向扫描逻辑错误，导致计算结果与 m 不一致。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 接收 m 作为输入，但通过 rand() 随机计算其值，导致无法保证输出字符串的可爱度恰好为 m。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The program reads m as input to determine the grid's column count for diagonal sum calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;RAND()&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"rand() 在 Program Segment 1/2 中被错误使用，导致 n 和 m 不可控，是程序逻辑失效的根本技术错误。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串外串 is the problem being attempted by the code in Program Segment 1/2, which incorrectly implements its solution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[2][M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 uses sum[2][M] to precompute diagonal sums for optimization in calculating Dragon's Breath damage."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[2][M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 uses sum2[2][M] to precompute the other set of diagonal sums for Dragon's Breath damage calculation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 reads and stores the grid's monster counts into the 2D vector a for processing."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 is a computational attempt to solve the problem of maximizing the effect of Dragon's Breath by calculating diagonal sums."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program implements an algorithm to compute the maximum damage possible from Dragon's Breath by evaluating diagonal sums across the grid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Program Segment 1/2 operates on the Grid Map data structure to compute optimal Dragon's Breath usage."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROGRAM SEGMENT 1/2&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The program reads and stores monster counts a_{i,j} in a 2D array to compute diagonal sums for Dragon's Breath optimization."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M = 2E5 + 7&quot;" target="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"M defines the maximum possible value range for a_i, constraining the input size and memory allocation for the array elements in the student’s program."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I,R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The range [l_i, r_i] for each position must be a subset of or overlap with the universal range 1~n to allow a valid permutation to exist."&lt;SEP&gt;"[l_i,r_i] 的取值必须是 1 \sim n 的子集，否则无法构造合法排列，二者构成数值空间的包含与约束关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;\{2,3,1,5,4\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{2,3,1,5,4\} is a valid instance of a permutation using all integers from 1 to 5, demonstrating compliance with the 1~n requirement."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;\{1,2,2\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{1,2,2\} violates the 1~n uniqueness constraint by duplicating the value 2, making it invalid despite using numbers within range."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;\{1,3,4\}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"\{1,3,4\} violates the 1~n completeness constraint by omitting 2 and 5 (for n=5), making it invalid even though no duplicates exist."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗”作为题目名称，其内涵依赖于使用 1 \sim n 的完整整数集合来构建有序排列。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I,R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗”的核心挑战在于满足每个位置的区间约束 [l_i,r_i]，是题目的关键限制条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L = 1&quot;" target="&quot;IF(L &gt;= A[I].L &amp;&amp; L &lt;= A[I].R) ...&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l = 1 作为初始值被贪心分配事件使用，逐次递增以尝试填充每个区间，是数值分配的驱动变量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L = 1&quot;" target="&quot;STD::SORT(A + 1, A + 1 + N)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The sorting step enables the greedy assignment starting from l = 1, ensuring smallest available values are assigned first to satisfy constraints."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::SORT(...)&quot;" target="&quot;IF(L &gt;= A[I].L &amp;&amp; L &lt;= A[I].R) ...&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"排序事件为贪心分配事件提供处理顺序，二者共同构成学生程序的核心逻辑流程。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::SORT(...)&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"排序策略是学生为解决‘井然有序之窗’所采用的算法手段，试图通过左边界排序实现贪心构造。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 ~ N&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"1 ~ n 是‘井然有序之窗’问题中排列元素的合法数值范围，构成问题的核心约束条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;1 ~ N&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"[l_i, r_i] constraints must be subsets of or aligned with the domain 1 ~ n for a valid permutation to exist, making them fundamentally interdependent."&lt;SEP&gt;"每个 [l_i, r_i] 区间必须是 1 ~ n 的子集，否则排列无法合法构造，二者存在包含约束关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;" target="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗”事件的合法性判断完全依赖于每个位置是否满足 [l_i, r_i] 的区间约束。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;排列构造&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"[l_i, r_i] 是排列构造事件必须满足的硬性约束，决定了哪些数值可被分配到各位置。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;第 I 个元素&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"第 i 个元素 的取值必须严格位于 [l_i, r_i] 区间内，这是问题对每个位置的直接约束。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;1~N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"[l_i, r_i] 的取值必须是 1~n 的子集，且所有区间的并集必须覆盖 1~n 才能构成合法排列，二者在数值空间上存在强依赖关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;[L_I, R_I]&quot;" target="&quot;构造排列问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"构造排列问题的约束完全由 [l_i, r_i] 区间集合定义，每个位置的取值范围直接决定问题是否有解。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE()&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T controls the number of times solve() is called, processing each test case in the input."&lt;SEP&gt;"solve() 函数被 T 次循环调用，T 控制其执行次数，是程序结构中驱动求解过程的控制变量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-61548360973c5cefdc1038d32bf69e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The string t must have cuteness exactly equal to m, which is the core condition to be satisfied in the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"t must have a 可爱度 exactly equal to m, making m the target value the string t must satisfy."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"t is the central object in the ‘字符串外串’ problem — the string whose properties are being analyzed and constructed."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 revolves around constructing the string t to satisfy the cuteness condition defined in the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T controls the number of times the solve function is called, making it the loop driver for processing multiple test cases in the program."&lt;SEP&gt;"T is the number of test cases, each requiring a call to solve, making it the outer loop controlling the execution of the algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;T&quot;" target="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T is the node counter used in the persistent segment tree implementation to generate unique node IDs during modifications, essential for maintaining persistence."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;第 I 个元素&quot;" target="&quot;排列构造&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"排列构造事件的目标是为每个第 i 个元素分配一个唯一且符合区间约束的值。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;构造排列问题&quot;" target="&quot;1~N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"构造排列问题的解空间严格限定在 1~n 的整数排列内，这是问题定义的数学前提。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::SORT&quot;" target="&quot;STD::UNIQUE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::sort must be called before std::unique to ensure consecutive duplicates are removed correctly, establishing a procedural dependency in the algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STD::SORT&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[5]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::sort arranges the sum[5] array by operation cost, allowing the algorithm to pick the minimal-cost median candidate."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;">
      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 is the protagonist of the event '硝基甲苯之袭', tasked with solving the algorithmic challenge described in the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一事件的主体，他正在解决该问题中的计算任务。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一事件的主体，负责解决该问题中的数学计算任务。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是‘硝基甲苯之袭’这一事件的主体，负责解决该题目所描述的算法问题。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是'硝基甲苯之袭'这一算法事件中的主要操作者，负责解决该问题中的数学计算任务。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小苯&quot;" target="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 is the person who is trying to compute pairs involving a_i as part of the mathematical condition in the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who must determine valid pairs involving a_i as one element in the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who must evaluate all possible a_i elements in the array to find valid pairs satisfying the xor-gcd condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who needs to compute pairs involving a_i as one of the two elements satisfying the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."</data>
