      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 is the person who is trying to compute pairs involving a_j as part of the mathematical condition in the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the problem solver who needs to compute pairs involving a_j as the second element satisfying the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 must consider every a_j (with j &gt; i) to test the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j), making a_j a critical component of his computational task."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 must consider all a_j elements (j &gt; i) to find valid pairs satisfying the mathematical condition."</data>
