    <edge source="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;" target="&quot;A_I XOR A_J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"硝基甲苯之袭' is the named event that centers on the computational challenge of finding pairs where a_i xor a_j equals gcd(a_i, a_j), making this relationship the core of the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
