    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;硝基甲苯之袭&quot;" target="&quot;GCD(A_I, A_J)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The event '硝基甲苯之袭' is defined by the requirement that the GCD of pairs must equal their XOR, making gcd(a_i, a_j) a defining constraint of the event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_I&quot;" target="&quot;GCD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a_i is one of the two integers for which the gcd function is computed as part of the problem's constraint condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8b7bfa15e059051e591b4500f150f4b0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
