      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"gcd and xor are the two core mathematical operations whose equality defines the problem’s constraint, forming the central logic of the task."&lt;SEP&gt;"gcd and xor are two mathematical operations that are equated in the problem’s constraint, forming the core logic condition to be satisfied by element pairs."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-54e2ed195b50756e6f2448b5f990c4b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9bb8ae3fef264eb1654019ea7fdabc</data>
