      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The two expressions are directly compared in the problem’s core constraint: for a valid pair, their values must be numerically equal, making this a critical functional relationship."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-91d5ad5a52520d2ee66b7e8855842a44</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
