      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[5] stores the total operation costs for each candidate mid value, enabling selection of the optimal one to minimize operations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MID2&quot;" target="&quot;MID1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"mid1 and mid2 are compared to determine if a single value can serve as both target elements in the dual array, a key logic branch in the algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"mid2 is compared with mid1, but mid1 is undefined, leading to unpredictable conditional behavior and incorrect final operation counting."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385</data>
