      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) 是矩阵中每个砖块的唯一地址标识，二者是点与空间结构的对应关系，构成问题建模的基础。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-61548360973c5cefdc1038d32bf69e3c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze selects coordinates (i,j) on the grid to unleash Dragon's Breath, making (i,j) the target of her ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze targets specific (i,j) coordinates on the grid to unleash Dragon's Breath, making (i,j) the input for her ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze targets specific (i,j) coordinates on the grid map to unleash Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">49.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) is the coordinate system that defines the structure and indexing of the Grid Map."&lt;SEP&gt;"(i,j) is the coordinate system used to reference every cell within the Grid Map."&lt;SEP&gt;"(i,j) is the coordinate system that structures the Grid Map, uniquely identifying each cell."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is structured using the coordinate system (i,j) to uniquely identify each cell's monster count."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is structured using the (i,j) coordinate system to uniquely identify each cell."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;(I,J)&quot;" target="&quot;S_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"(i,j) is the coordinate that directly references the state variable s_{i,j} to determine the content of each cell on the board."&lt;SEP&gt;"(i,j) is the coordinate that indexes the state variable s_{i,j}, defining the exact location and content of each cell in the tic-tac-toe grid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0414d324dc902fa7bfe392b580d12b0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fbf67613a3aed791c8801433f136cd8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;四连通&quot;" target="&quot;共边&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"四连通定义了邻接关系，共边是四连通关系中的一种具体表现形式，用于判断蓝色与灰色砖块的接触。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-18e8858aadef99b81cf3431326cb24cb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;四连通&quot;" target="&quot;程序段&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"程序段中 dx[] 和 dy[] 数组定义了上下左右四个方向，实现四连通的遍历逻辑，是算法核心。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;悬空&quot;" target="&quot;边界&quot;">
      <data key="d3">23.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"悬空是针对非边界蓝色极大连通块的掉落条件，而边界上的连通块被豁免此要求，二者互为逻辑对立条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"悬空条件在边界上被忽略，边界决定了悬空规则是否适用，是两个事件的逻辑分界点。"&lt;SEP&gt;"悬空概念仅在非边界区域有意义，边界上的蓝色极大连通块被豁免悬空约束，二者是互斥的边界条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0bcd1771d7e55d80f714bbc3d88370bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61548360973c5cefdc1038d32bf69e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae077aa7a5a85409843a4ac34869acd1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;悬空&quot;" target="&quot;边界上的蓝色极大连通块&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"悬空概念在边界上的蓝色极大连通块中被明确忽略，这是其特殊处理规则的核心。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;敲碎&quot;" target="&quot;最小敲碎数&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"敲碎是实现最小敲碎数目标的唯一操作方式，最小敲碎数是敲碎行为的优化结果。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-18e8858aadef99b81cf3431326cb24cb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;敲碎&quot;" target="&quot;程序段&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"程序段虽未完整实现，但其 BFS 框架意图是计算敲碎最少灰色砖块数，目标与敲碎事件直接对应。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS reads values from array A to determine traversable nodes (1s) and boundaries (0s)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm reads grid values from the 2D array 'a' to determine traversable and boundary cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"The bfs function reads and modifies the grid 'a' to explore connected components of 1s and count adjacent 0s."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;VIS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">29.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS uses the VIS array to mark visited cells and avoid reprocessing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm uses the 'vis' array to mark visited cells and prevent reprocessing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The bfs function uses the 'vis' array to mark visited cells and avoid reprocessing, which is essential for algorithm correctness."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;ANS1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS updates ANS1 when a larger connected component is found."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm updates ans1 to track the largest connected component size found."&lt;SEP&gt;"The bfs function updates 'ans1' to store the size of the largest connected component found during traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS updates MIN to store the smallest number of surrounding 0s among the largest components."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm updates Min to store the minimum boundary count among the largest components."&lt;SEP&gt;"The bfs function updates 'Min' to track the minimum number of adjacent 0s for the largest component, used for final output."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The solve function calls BFS for each unvisited 1 in the grid to compute connected components."&lt;SEP&gt;"The solve function calls bfs repeatedly for each unvisited 1 in the grid, making bfs the core computational subroutine."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">37.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS aims to reach m as the target state; success is determined if m is encountered during traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"BFS uses M as a boundary constraint to validate grid coordinates during traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm requires m (number of columns) to validate grid boundaries during traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"BFS算法的目标是达到m，m是其搜索的终止条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;CNT1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"CNT1 is incremented within BFS to count the size of each connected component of 1s."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm increments cnt1 to count the number of connected 1s in each component."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;CNT2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"CNT2 is incremented within BFS to count surrounding 0s for each component."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BFS algorithm increments cnt2 to count adjacent 0s (boundary cells) surrounding each component."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;DX&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm uses the dx array to navigate horizontally across the grid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;DY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm uses the dy array to navigate vertically across the grid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;STD::QUEUE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm relies on std::queue to manage the frontier of cells to be processed."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;F&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS uses the F map to track and count unique adjacent 0s without duplication."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;小L的数学题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS是小L的数学题所采用的解决方案策略，用于系统性地探索从n到m的所有可能操作路径。"</data>
