    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A is a 2D array of size N x M, so M defines its column dimension."&lt;SEP&gt;"The variable 'm' defines the number of columns in the grid 'a', establishing the spatial dimension for the algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the column bounds of array 'a'; if m exceeds actual array width, it triggers index errors during v &lt;= m checks."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43422d516179991d5c796063c71f443</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">34.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The solve function must ensure the output string has exactly m as its可爱度, making m a critical input to the function's logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The solve function reads m from input to define the grid dimensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"solve 函数接收 m 作为输入参数，用于计算 cnt = 2*m - n 并决定输出字符分布，是算法构造的关键依据。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The solve function must process m queries, making m a critical input parameter that dictates the number of operations to perform."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m is the target value that the 可爱度 of string t must exactly equal, making it the goal of the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"m is the target 可爱度 value that the constructed string must exactly achieve, making it the central objective of the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"m是题目要求字符串达到的目标可爱度值，是算法验证的核心输出条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d58149e2705f5337a0bc1e192ab33a56</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">46.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m 是‘字符串外串’事件中需要匹配的可爱度目标值，是问题求解的核心输出条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是‘字符串外串’问题中定义可爱度的目标值，是判断解是否存在和构造字符串的核心依据。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是‘字符串外串’问题中要求达到的目标可爱度值，是判断是否存在合法字符串 t 的核心条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m 是‘字符串外串’问题的目标参数，要求字符串的可爱度恰好等于 m，是问题求解的核心目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 requires the string t to have cuteness exactly m, which is the central goal of the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;字符串 T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m 是字符串 t 必须满足的可爱度目标值，是判断其有效性的重要标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;STD::CIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::cin 用于读取用户输入的 m 值，是程序判断可爱度目标的唯一输入来源。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-34b609ebf637b7a586a64207000b2d2e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Map has m columns, defining its horizontal size and constraining valid coordinate ranges."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map has m columns, making m a fundamental dimension defining its size."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, directly influencing the range and possible positions for Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"m defines the number of columns in the Grid Map, establishing its horizontal size."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"v is a column index that is bounded by m, and iterates from 1 to m during diagonal summation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">37.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L的目标是将数字n变为m，m是操作的期望输出目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L的目标是将数字n变换为m，m是小L操作的期望输出目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L的目标是将数字n通过运算变为m，m是其操作的期望输出目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L的目标是将数字n变为m，m是运算的最终目标，二者构成任务导向关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;平方和开方运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m is the target value that the operations aim to achieve, serving as the termination condition for the transformation sequence."&lt;SEP&gt;"数字m是平方和开方运算的期望结果，运算的合法性取决于能否从n到达m。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m是平方和开方运算的目标输出，运算的可行性取决于能否从n到达m。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb748d740807dc942d42a2dc4f25d05d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;小L的数学题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m是‘小L的数学题’事件的目标输出数值，决定问题是否可解。"&lt;SEP&gt;"m是小L的数学题中的目标输出参数，是判断操作可行性的关键标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c22dbdf1f3163e7e66ae88a5409cc589</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;INTEGER SQUARE ROOT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"If m is a perfect square or can be reached via repeated square roots, then applying Integer Square Root to larger numbers may lead to m."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;MULTIPLICATION BY 2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"If m is reachable by doubling smaller numbers, then Multiplication by 2 is the key operation to reach m from values below it."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Persistent Segment Tree is queried m times, once for each of the independent queries in the problem, making m a key factor in its usage."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m is the total number of independent queries to be processed, each involving a subinterval and a target position c_i."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;M&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"m determines the number of independent subinterval sorting queries that must be processed by the solution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DX&quot;" target="&quot;DY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The arrays 'dx' and 'dy' work together to define the four possible directions (up, down, left, right) for grid traversal in BFS."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;VIS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'vis' array is used in conjunction with 'a' to track which cells have been processed during BFS, ensuring correct traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;SOLVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The solve function initializes the grid 'a' from input data, setting up the problem space for BFS."&lt;SEP&gt;"The solve function populates the grid array 'a' from string input."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5d353b59db67cab15706b3f74c4fa457&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24131db9a2e06f7a88e10188152d99d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列由两段非相邻子串（由不同字符构成）和中间重复的 'a' 构成，'a' 是连接两段的桥梁字符。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符 'a' 被重复输出用于构造不连续子序列的中间重复段，是满足 a=b 条件的关键组成部分。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;连续子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a 是题目中用于表示连续子串的符号，直接对应连续子串这一概念。"&lt;SEP&gt;"连续子串必须包含与不连续子序列相同的字符，而 'a' 是两者共有的核心字符，用于保证 a=b。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;S&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"字符串s由字符a（'a'）和其他小写字母构造，a是构建子串和子序列的基础字符。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;B&quot;">
      <data key="d3">59.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a and b are the two binary numbers whose XOR result must equal c; they are directly manipulated through operations to achieve the target condition a⊕b=c."&lt;SEP&gt;"a and b are the two binary numbers whose bitwise XOR must equal c, and both are subject to identical operations (flips and swaps)."&lt;SEP&gt;"a 和 b 必须完全相等，是‘可爱度’定义的核心要求，二者构成等价关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a 和 b 是相互作用的二进制数，它们的异或结果决定是否满足目标，操作 a 会影响 b 的相对效果，反之亦然。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a和b是参与异或运算的两个二进制数，它们的每一位共同决定a⊕b的结果，是问题中直接关联的两个实体。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a和b共同参与异或运算以匹配c，二者互为运算伙伴，操作上存在协同优化关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd5a87d368619780b9c83a36a26e8d95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;SUM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sum accumulates values from array 'a' during iteration, and improper handling of 'a'’s indices causes the runtime error."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum is populated using values from array 'a', and incorrect indexing (e.g., sum[1][i] = Sum) may lead to undefined behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"a is the source data structure from which values are read and accumulated during the Sum operation along diagonals."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2 is computed from array 'a' using while loops with decrementing indices (u--, v--), which can lead to negative indices and runtime crashes."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum2 stores the results of summation operations performed on elements of array a, making a the foundational input to sum2."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ea1f9429252e70930605371d38b928</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;U&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"u is used as a row index to access array 'a', and decrements (u--) without bounds checks lead to negative indices and runtime crashes."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"v is used as a column index to access array 'a', and decrements (v--) without validation cause out-of-bounds memory access."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fa7949c55def1b07cb22840b26c2d9a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;A⊕B=C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
