    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">37.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The XOR of a and b must equal c, so a is intrinsically linked to c as one of the two operands whose combination produces c."&lt;SEP&gt;"The goal is to transform a (via operations) such that a⊕b equals c, making c the target outcome for a's state."&lt;SEP&gt;"a需要通过操作调整，使得a⊕b的结果等于c，c是a的运算目标，两者通过异或关系紧密绑定。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a与c通过异或运算关联，目标是使a⊕b=c成立，因此a的每一位值直接影响c的可达成性。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57add46cc4c97ae41d878b651704f581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1</data>
