    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it on the grid map to defeat monsters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to defeat monsters on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to destroy monsters on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, directing it to maximize monster elimination on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to destroy monsters on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, directing it to specific coordinates on the grid to defeat monsters."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">35.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map by selecting coordinates to activate Dragon's Breath, making the grid the operational domain of her ability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map, selecting coordinates to unleash Dragon's Breath and maximize monster elimination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the grid map, selecting coordinates to maximize the effect of Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze operates on the Grid Map, selecting coordinates to unleash Dragon's Breath and maximize monster elimination."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">29.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze's effectiveness depends on the monster counts a_{i,j} at each grid cell to maximize damage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze's goal is to maximize the sum of a_{i,j} values destroyed by Dragon's Breath, making a_{i,j} the core data she acts upon."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze's goal is to maximize the sum of a_{i,j} values hit by Dragon's Breath, so she relies on the monster counts at each (i,j)."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;(X,Y)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze selects the coordinate (x,y) as the origin point to activate Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;" target="&quot;ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze is the originator of the Absolute Expectation problem, which involves computing the expected value of a sequence's absolute difference sum."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the originator or subject of the Absolute Expectation problem, posing the question about the expected value of the sequence's value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the originator or subject of the Absolute Expectation problem, as the problem is framed around their inquiry into the expected value of the sequence's value function."</data>
