      <data key="d3">59.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath is an ability that acts upon the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal lines based on the chosen center coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates on the Grid Map, affecting monster counts along diagonal lines across the grid's coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is applied on the grid map, affecting cells along diagonal paths to eliminate monsters based on their positions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that acts upon the grid map, destroying monsters along diagonal paths defined by the grid's coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates exclusively on the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal lines from the targeted coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that acts upon the Grid Map, destroying monsters along diagonal paths defined by the grid's coordinates."</data>
