      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i is the loop index that determines the starting column for diagonal summation, directly controlling the Sum computation for each diagonal."&lt;SEP&gt;"i is used to index the sum array (sum[1][i]), but if sum is not properly allocated or initialized, this leads to undefined behavior."</data>
