    <edge source="&quot;U&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"u and v are coupled variables that move in tandem during diagonal traversal, with u decreasing while v increases (or both decrease), maintaining diagonal alignment."&lt;SEP&gt;"u and v are paired loop variables that move diagonally across array 'a'; their simultaneous decrement (u--, v--) in the second while loop creates uncontrolled access beyond array boundaries."</data>
