      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The win condition defines the objective and victory criteria of the tic-tac-toe game, determining when a player has successfully completed a line of three symbols."&lt;SEP&gt;"The win condition defines the objective and victory criteria of the tic-tac-toe game, determining when a player has won."</data>
