      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 3x3 grid is the physical and structural foundation of the tic-tac-toe game, defining all possible move positions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The tic-tac-toe game is played entirely on the 3x3 grid, which defines the structure and constraints of all moves and winning conditions."</data>
