    <edge source="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;" target="&quot;O&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"O is a core symbol in the tic-tac-toe game, used to track 炸鸡's progress toward forming a winning line of three."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'O' marks are central to the objective of the tic-tac-toe game, as 炸鸡 must align three 'O's to win."&lt;SEP&gt;"The symbol 'O' is a fundamental component of the tic-tac-toe game, representing the opponent's attempts to achieve three-in-a-row."&lt;SEP&gt;"O marks are integral to the state of the tic-tac-toe game, contributing to potential winning lines and game outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a core symbolic element of the tic-tac-toe game, used to track 炸鸡's progress toward achieving three-in-a-row."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;" target="&quot;G&quot;">
      <data key="d3">31.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"G denotes unoccupied positions on the board, which are critical to determining possible future moves and strategies in the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"G is a fundamental state in the tic-tac-toe game's board representation, indicating unoccupied positions that are critical for determining possible future moves."&lt;SEP&gt;"The symbol 'G' indicates empty spaces in the tic-tac-toe game, which are critical for determining possible future moves and game outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"G is a state indicator within the tic-tac-toe game’s grid, representing unoccupied positions that are critical for determining possible future moves and strategies."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
