      <data key="d3">42.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"O marks are placed within the 3x3 grid at specific (i,j) coordinates to represent 炸鸡's moves."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'O' marks are placed within the 3x3 grid, which is the structural framework of the game where all player actions occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the spatial domain where 'O' marks are placed by 炸鸡, and the positions of 'O' determine potential winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the spatial domain where 'O' marks are placed by 炸鸡, defining the game state."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid is the spatial structure upon which 'O' symbols are placed by 炸鸡 to attempt to achieve a winning line."</data>
