    <edge source="&quot;3X3 BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;WIN CONDITION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The win condition depends entirely on the configuration of symbols ('X', 'O') on the 3x3 board, specifically requiring three in a row, column, or diagonal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ROW&quot;" target="&quot;3X3 GRID&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Rows are fundamental structural components of the 3x3 grid, forming one of the three possible winning line types."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;COLUMN&quot;" target="&quot;3X3 GRID&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Columns are fundamental structural components of the 3x3 grid, forming one of the three possible winning line types."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井字棋&quot;" target="&quot;行&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"行是井字棋获胜条件的三种基本形态之一，构成游戏规则的核心组成部分。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井字棋&quot;" target="&quot;列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"列是井字棋获胜条件的三种基本形态之一，与行、对角线共同定义胜利标准。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井字棋&quot;" target="&quot;对角线&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"对角线是井字棋获胜条件的第三种形态，是决定胜负的关键路径之一，尤其在残局中常成为战术焦点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井字棋&quot;" target="&quot;残局&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"残局是井字棋对局的一个特定阶段，其状态（落子分布、轮次、特权状态）决定了后续策略分析的起点和复杂度。"&lt;SEP&gt;"残局是井字棋对弈过程中的一个特定阶段，作为问题输入的起点，决定了后续行动与胜负分析的基础。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井字棋&quot;" target="&quot;连成一线&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连成一线是井字棋游戏的核心胜利机制，决定了游戏的胜负逻辑。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井字棋&quot;" target="&quot;连续走两步&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续走两步是井字棋残局中引入的特殊规则变体，改变了传统轮流制，影响游戏策略平衡。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;井字棋&quot;" target="&quot;THREE-IN-A-LINE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Three-in-a-line is the core winning mechanism that defines the objective of the tic-tac-toe game."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;棋盘&quot;" target="&quot;三连一线&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"棋盘的3x3结构定义了所有可能的三连一线路径（3行+3列+2对角线），是获胜条件的物理载体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;棋盘&quot;" target="&quot;残局&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"残局的状态完全由棋盘当前的'X'、'O'、'G'分布定义，棋盘是残局的唯一数据载体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;棋盘&quot;" target="&quot;S_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"s_{i,j}是描述棋盘每个单元格状态的符号系统，二者是数据表示与物理结构的对应关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;三连一线&quot;" target="&quot;连续走两步特权&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续走两步特权赋予小L在单次行动中制造两个'X'的机会，极大提升其形成三连一线的可能性，是胜负分析的核心变量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续走两步特权&quot;" target="&quot;连成一线&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续走两步特权直接增强小L达成连成一线的可能性，是影响该事件能否被触发的核心机制。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;3X3 GRID&quot;" target="&quot;DIAGONAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Diagonals are fundamental structural components of the 3x3 grid, forming one of the three possible winning line types."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;3X3 GRID&quot;" target="&quot;WIN CONDITION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 3x3 grid provides the structural framework within which the win condition is evaluated via rows, columns, and diagonals."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INSTRUCTOR / EVALUATOR&quot;" target="&quot;99-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The instructor or automated system created and assigned record ID 99-1 to document the student's error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fe255a1fe76c6cdfb705f9ea60c587de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
