      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The error was logged by the evaluator at the timestamp 2025-02-08 15:49:29, establishing accountability and traceability."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fe255a1fe76c6cdfb705f9ea60c587de</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;WIN CONDITION&quot;" target="&quot;TWO-MOVE PRIVILEGE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The two-move privilege could potentially allow 小L to create an unavoidable win condition by setting up a fork or completing a line in one turn."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;WIN CONDITION&quot;" target="&quot;DOUBLE MOVE PRIVILEGE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The double move privilege alters the dynamics of achieving the win condition by giving 小L an opportunity to create two threats or complete a line in one turn, potentially bypassing normal turn-based constraints."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;3X3棋盘&quot;" target="&quot;连成一线&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"3x3棋盘的结构定义了所有可能的连成一线路径（3行+3列+2对角线），是该事件发生的唯一物理载体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;S_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;连成一线&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"s_{i,j}的值决定了是否形成连成一线的获胜条件，是判断游戏胜负的底层数据依据。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CODE LOGIC&quot;" target="&quot;MATRIX&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The code logic operates directly on the matrix structure, iterating over its rows, columns, and diagonal to evaluate conditions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3f02234c0d5217769809ae214a58779b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[K][3 - K + 1]&quot;" target="&quot;DIAGONAL CHECK&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The expression a[k][3 - k + 1] is the core component of the diagonal check algorithm that failed in the student’s submission."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7effc3a8936d5e21e04e38b0253505c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;F = 1&quot;" target="&quot;DIAGONAL CHECK&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag f = 1 is used within the diagonal check to signal the presence of an element &gt; 1, but its logic may be inverted or misused."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7effc3a8936d5e21e04e38b0253505c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLAG = 1&quot;" target="&quot;DIAGONAL CHECK&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag = 1 is set when no anomalies are found in the diagonal check, but its scope or timing may conflict with f’s usage."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7effc3a8936d5e21e04e38b0253505c0</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
