      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The programming task revolves around analyzing the two-dimensional array a[i][j] to determine flag conditions based on element values."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0ae1fc917022eddc74e2fec3c8d34bb4</data>
