    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ARRAY A[I][J]&quot;" target="&quot;FLAG VARIABLE F&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag variable f is set based on comparisons of elements in array a[i][j], specifically checking if any value exceeds 1 in a row, column, or diagonal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0ae1fc917022eddc74e2fec3c8d34bb4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLAG VARIABLE F&quot;" target="&quot;FLAG VARIABLE FLAG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag variable flag depends on the state of f; if all f values are 0, flag is set to 1, indicating correct propagation of conditions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0ae1fc917022eddc74e2fec3c8d34bb4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
