    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;">
      <data key="d3">54.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因无法编写checker而寻求帮助，二者存在直接创作与依赖关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因无法编写checker而寻求帮助，二者存在直接创作与依赖关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因无法编写checker而寻求帮助，二者是直接的创作与问题关联关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因该题目而产生编写checker的需求，二者是创作与依赖关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，因无法编写checker而寻求帮助，直接关联该事件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡是《小鸡的排列构造》题目的出题者，该题目是本题所依赖的背景问题。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fbb166f8ec0a1178f2d878ecaab5e98</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;PERMUTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡’s problem is built around the concept of permutations, which are the fundamental input structure for all queries."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;PROBLEM: 小鸡的排列构造的CHECKER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡 created the problem '小鸡的排列构造的checker' as an extension of '小鸡的排列构造', and is seeking help because he cannot implement a correct checker for it."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小鸡&quot;" target="&quot;CHECKER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小鸡 is the creator of the problem and is unable to implement the checker, which is why they seek help."&lt;SEP&gt;"小鸡 is unable to write a correct checker for the problem, which is why they are seeking help, indicating direct dependency and failure point."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;" target="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"《小鸡的排列构造》requires solving queries about element positions after sorting subarrays, a task efficiently addressed by the Persistent Segment Tree technique used in the student's code."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9fc322d7318797c103f604c41177f547</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;108-1&quot;" target="&quot;2025-02-11 14:07:51&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The organization 108-1 is associated with the event timestamped at 2025-02-11 14:07:51, indicating it was active or recorded an action at that time."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-eb58fd6ca0592bab1397eeb0fc1e161d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;C_I&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"c_i is the original position within the subinterval [l_i, r_i] whose new position after sorting must be tracked."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;C_I&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"c_i specifies the original position of the element whose new location after sorting must be tracked, making it the target of the sorting operation’s output."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-dae03b8ab8904bfd565e3a28acd596fe</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERMUTATION&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Permutation is the data structure upon which subinterval sorting is applied in every query."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERMUTATION&quot;" target="&quot;SUBINTERVAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Each subinterval is a contiguous segment extracted from the permutation, which is then sorted independently for each query."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4bbd9f3652366c894d3ef5e4694e35b3</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUBINTERVAL SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;ELEMENT POSITION TRACKING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Element position tracking is the direct result of performing subinterval sorting — one cannot be done without the other in this problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-be1dd97aefef7c188309086d2d51eecb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L_I, R_I, C_I&quot;" target="&quot;PROBLEM: 小鸡的排列构造的CHECKER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l_i, r_i, c_i define the inputs for each query in the problem, and the solution must compute the new position of the element at c_i after sorting the subarray [l_i, r_i]."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;" target="&quot;ROOT[I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"root[i] is the root of the persistent segment tree after processing the first i elements, forming the state snapshots needed for range queries between prefixes."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PERSISTENT SEGMENT TREE&quot;" target="&quot;CNT[], LS[], RS[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"cnt[], ls[], rs[] are the underlying arrays that implement the persistent segment tree’s structure and functionality, storing counts and child pointers for each node."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e2289b634557fb82c8cd29d3444ae10</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 109-1&quot;" target="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:16&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The record ID is associated with the timestamp, indicating that this specific data entry was logged at this exact moment in time."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f9a4e754cf4e65b38587d0bdb951cadc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
